  "interpretation": "<ul>\n<li data-start=\"1826\" data-end=\"1926\">\n<p data-start=\"1828\" data-end=\"1847\"><span style=\"font-size: 9px;\"><strong data-start=\"1828\" data-end=\"1845\">Normal Study:</strong></span></p>\n<ul data-start=\"1850\" data-end=\"1926\">\n<li style=\"font-size: 9px;\" data-start=\"1850\" data-end=\"1926\">\n<p data-start=\"1852\" data-end=\"1926\"><span style=\"font-size: 9px;\">Conduction velocities, amplitudes, and latencies within reference range.</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 9px;\" data-start=\"1928\" data-end=\"2229\">\n<p data-start=\"1930\" data-end=\"1954\"><span style=\"font-size: 9px;\"><strong data-start=\"1930\" data-end=\"1952\">Abnormal Findings:</strong></span></p>\n<ul data-start=\"1957\" data-end=\"2229\">\n<li style=\"font-size: 9px;\" data-start=\"1957\" data-end=\"2041\">\n<p data-start=\"1959\" data-end=\"2041\"><span style=\"font-size: 9px;\"><strong data-start=\"1959\" data-end=\"1990\">Slowed conduction velocity:</strong> Suggests <strong data-start=\"2000\" data-end=\"2017\">demyelination</strong> (e.g., neuropathies).</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 9px;\" data-start=\"2044\" data-end=\"2119\">\n<p data-start=\"2046\" data-end=\"2119\"><span style=\"font-size: 9px;\"><strong data-start=\"2046\" data-end=\"2069\">Reduced amplitudes:</strong> Indicates <strong data-start=\"2080\" data-end=\"2095\">axonal loss</strong> or severe neuropathy.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 9px;\" data-start=\"2122\" data-end=\"2229\">\n<p data-start=\"2124\" data-end=\"2229\"><span style=\"font-size: 9px;\"><strong data-start=\"2124\" data-end=\"2166\">Prolonged latencies or F-wave changes:</strong> May suggest <strong data-start=\"2179\" data-end=\"2226\">proximal nerve involvement or radiculopathy</strong>.</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 9px;\" data-start=\"2231\" data-end=\"2313\">\n<p data-start=\"2233\" data-end=\"2313\"><span style=\"font-size: 9px;\">Should be interpreted along with <strong data-start=\"2266\" data-end=\"2288\">EMG (if performed)</strong> and clinical findings.</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>",
